# Copy to .env and adjust. .env is git-ignored; this file is not.

# ─── Which image ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is the only setting that changes what the stack actually is.
# README.md has the full comparison; the short version:
#
#   main     WebUI only, CPU. Models run somewhere else.      (default)
#   latest   identical to main — both are the same rolling build
#   cuda     + CUDA runtime. Speeds up RAG embeddings and Whisper STT,
#            NOT chat. Needs an NVIDIA host + Container Toolkit.
#   ollama   + Ollama bundled inside the same container.
#   v0.11.0  a frozen release. main/latest move under you.
#
#OWUI_TAG=main

# With OWUI_TAG=cuda or ollama on an NVIDIA host, also uncomment
# `gpus: all` in compose.yaml — the tag alone does not grant GPU access.

# ─── Where the models are ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Skip this and set it in the UI instead if you prefer.
#   Ollama on the Docker host      http://host.docker.internal:11434
#   Ollama in another container    http://ollama:11434
#   Ollama on a Mac or other box   http://192.168.1.x:11434
#   OWUI_TAG=ollama                leave unset — it is already local
#OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:11434

# ─── Paths ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Chats, users, settings, RAG vector DB and model caches. Back this up.
#DATA_PATH=./open-webui

# Pulled Ollama models. ONLY used with OWUI_TAG=ollama, and only if you
# uncomment the matching line in compose.yaml. Tens of GB.
#OLLAMA_PATH=./ollama

# ─── Ports ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#PORT=3033

#TZ=Europe/Paris

# ─── Optional ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Signs session cookies. Generated into DATA_PATH when unset, which is fine
# for a single instance. Set it explicitly if you move the data between
# hosts, otherwise everyone gets logged out.
#WEBUI_SECRET_KEY=
